            "detailed_description": "Deep Horizon is an underwater platformer that’s both relaxing and annoyingly clever in its puzzles and environments. With smooth controls, 360 degrees of freedom and 24 hand-crafted levels, each challenge is designed to charm and entertain.<br><br>Tired of saving the world from apocalyptic evil? Then take a short break in our bite-sized platformer-without-platforms. Revisit your ancient passions: collecting coins and getting all the gold stars in all the levels. Feel good. Smile.<br><br>Deep Horizon only looks all 8-bit and cute, though – underneath the surface are some tough challenges that will make you re-think just how much you can hate a level designer. What are you waiting for? Take plunge!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Full gamepad support, fully playable with just a mouse<br>    </li><li>24 hand-crafted levels, filled with secrets and dastardly traps<br>    </li><li>Enjoy 360 degrees of freedom platforming<br>    </li><li>Crisp retro graphics</li></ul>",
